-32s-14.3-32-32-32H80z"></path></svg></a></li><li class="Header-module-scss-module__ns2Wpq__browseLink"><a class="nx-text-link TextLink-module-scss-module__OmeQ6W__textLink" rel="" target="" data-test="text-link" href="/search" aria-disabled="false"><span>Browse</span></a></li><li><a class="nx-text-link TextLink-module-scss-module__OmeQ6W__textLink" rel="" target="" data-test="text-link" href="/api/auth/login" aria-disabled="false"><span>Sign In</span></a></li></ul></div></div></header><div class="nx-page-content IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__content"><div class="IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__heroAndMain"><div class="IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__hero" data-test="hero"><h1 class="IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__header" data-test="hero-header">Find OSS Components</h1><p class="IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__subHeader IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__searchSubHeader">As stewards of Central for nearly 20 years and inventors of both software supply chain management and Nexus Repository, Sonatype knows that the integrity of your build is critical.</p><div class="IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__searchOrBrowseContainer"><div class="SearchOrBrowse-module-scss-module__7nXS9W__container"><div class="SearchOrBrowse-module-scss-module__7nXS9W__searchWrapper"><div class="SearchOrBrowse-module-scss-module__7nXS9W__buttonsWrapper"><button type="button" class="SearchOrBrowse-module-scss-module__7nXS9W__advancedOptionsBtn nx-text-link" data-test="advanced-options-btn">Advanced Options</button></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="SccrAd-module-scss-module__iGgskW__productContainer" data-test="brand-awareness-container"><div class="SccrAd-module-scss-module__iGgskW__container"><div class="SccrAd-module-scss-module__iGgskW__column"><h2 class="nx-h2">2026 State of the Software Supply Chain</h2><p class="nx-p">Open source consumption hit<b> 9.8 trillion downloads in 2025</b> across public registries. This reliance on open source components reinforces the criticality of responsible dependency management.</p><a class="nx-btn nx-btn--tertiary" target="_blank" href="https://www.sonatype.com/state-of-the-software-supply-chain/Introduction/?utm_campaign=SCCR&amp;utm_source=Central&amp;utm_medium=Product&amp;utm_content=central&amp;utm_term=home">View the Report</a></div><div class="SccrAd-module-scss-module__iGgskW__image"><img alt="State Of The Software Supply Chain Report" loading="lazy" width="436" height="347" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/SSCR26-book-mock.0vc2f9hi91b6h.png"/></div></div></div></div><main class="nx-page-main"><section class="IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__pageContent" data-test="page-content"><div class="IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__pageContentColumn1"><h2 class="nx-h2 IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__mostPopularHeader" data-test="package-column-header">Most Popular Packages in Last 90 Days</h2><ul class="IndexPage-module-scss-module__2288cW__componentList"><li><div class="Card-module-scss-module__R4z76G__card Card-module-scss-module__R4z76G__vertical IndexComponentItem-module-scss-module__uQFnGW__card" data-test="index-component-card"><header class="ComponentCardHeader-module-scss-module__Ta_TgG__header IndexComponentItem-module-scss-module__uQFnGW__header"><h3 class="nx-h3 ComponentCardHeader-module-scss-module__Ta_TgG__name" data-test="component-card-name"><a class="nx-text-link ComponentCardHeader-module-scss-module__Ta_TgG__headerLink" rel="" target="" data-test="component-card-name-link" href="/artifact/org.apache.commons/commons-parent" aria-disabled="false"><span>commons-parent</span></a></h3><button class="ComponentCardHeader-module-scss-module__Ta_TgG__iconCopyPurl nx-btn nx-btn--icon-only" aria-label="Copy PURL" data-test="component-purl-copy-button"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="copy" class="svg-inline--fa fa-copy nx-icon" role="img" xmlns="htt